<title>USA: Schenectady Cty, N.Y., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Schenectady Cty, N.Y., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said it won $6.698 million of Schenectady Cty, N.Y., various purposes bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.833 percent.</p>
